hem, inventing untruth about Allāh. They have gone astray and were not [rightly] guided.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":140,"sd":null},{"k":"6:141","t":"And He it is who causes gardens to grow, [both] trellised and untrellised, and palm trees and crops of different [kinds of] food and olives and pomegranates, similar and dissimilar. Eat of [each of] its fruit when it yields and give its due [zakāh] on the day of its harvest. And be not excessive. Indeed, He does not like those who commit excess.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":141,"sd":null},{"k":"6:142","t":"And of the grazing livestock are carriers [of burdens] and those [too] small. Eat of what Allāh has provided for you and do not follow the footsteps of Satan. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":142,"sd":null}],"juz":8,"hizb":15,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}